  "description": "Fast LED retrofitting for Robert Juliat 700 series moulders, with 6 RGBCLA colours, with light output comparable to halogen lamps.\n- LED Source: RGBCLA COB LED (Red, Green, Blue, Cyan, Lime, Amber) - Color mixing with hue and saturation control\n- CCT Range: 2.700 K → 10.000 K\n- Color Rendition Average: CRI > 95, TLCI > 95\n- Green-Magenta adjustment: Continuously adjustable from full minus-green to full plus-green\n- Dimming: 8 or 16 bit, 5 selectable curves: Exponential, Logarithmic, Linear, Halo and Standard\n- Dimming Smooth Selection: Fast, Slow and Very Slow\n- Strobe: Electronic strobe, synchronized, random, pulse effect\n- Camera flicker control/Hz range: Yes: 20.000 Hz\n- Calibrated Cob: Yes\n- L80 Rating: 50.000 Hours\n- Voltage Input: 90-240 V, 50/60 Hz, auto-sensing\n- Power Consumption: 350 W Maximum\n- Power Connection: In and Out PowerCON TRUE1 Top\n- Data Connection: In and Out DMX 5 pin locking XLR connectors\n- Fan (controllable): Yes, 4 different settings: Silent, Studio, Auto, DMX regulated\n- Protocols: DMX-512, RDM (Remote Device Management)\n- RDM configuration: Yes\n- DMX Channels: 16 / 7 / 1 / Studio / RGB / Fine RGB / Sunrise Mode\n- Display: Graphic OLED with on-board selector for quick setting\n- Software Upload: Through DMX input (With RDM inteface code AC10011A001)",
